help.full:
I’m *AstroDaily* — a daily astrology digest powered by AI.

What I can do:
• compute your natal chart and transits based on birth date, time and place;
• build a short forecast for today from the most important aspects;
• gently highlight today’s themes: work, relationships, money, self-care;
• show your plan (/plan) and which features are available.

Main commands:
• /start — start or restart onboarding;
• /today — daily digest for today;
• /snooze — pause / resume delivery;
• /plan — see your current plan and features;
• /upgrade — learn how to get more features;
• /help — short help about the bot and commands.

_Note: I don’t provide medical, financial or legal advice. This is an informational and entertainment service._

